  UnitStory: "V\u1EDBi chi\u1EC1u cao 2m29, Yao Ming kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t
    trong nh\u1EEFng trung phong xu\u1EA5t s\u1EAFc nh\u1EA5t l\u1ECBch s\u1EED \u0111\u1ED9i
    tuy\u1EC3n Houston Rockets m\xE0 c\xF2n l\xE0 bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u01B0a
    b\xF3ng r\u1ED5 ch\xE2u \xC1 ra th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi.  Bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    Meme b\u1EA5t t\u1EED: Khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t c\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1EA3ng kho\xE1i c\u1EE7a
    Yao Ming trong m\u1ED9t cu\u1ED9c h\u1ECDp b\xE1o n\u0103m 2009 \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF
    th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng \"huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i meme\" (Bitch Please
    / Yao Ming Face) kinh \u0111i\u1EC3n nh\u1EA5t tr\xEAn Internet, g\u1EAFn li\u1EC1n
    v\u1EDBi v\u0103n h\xF3a truy\u1EC7n tranh ch\u1EBF (Rage Comics) m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi."
